      "settings": {
        "heading": "What our expert Shopify service looks like",
        "text": "<p>Get a competitive edge with a Shopify store that’s not only visually stunning but optimised for sales, engagement, and customer satisfaction. With a team that wants to see you win.</p>",
        "form_heading": "Free advice. No obligation. Find out if we’d be great together.",
        "form_text": "<p>You agree to be contacted by ANAGENCY.COM.AU PTY LTD and/or Shopify about their respective services. Your personal information will be processed in accordance with Shopify’s <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Privacy Policy\">Privacy Policy</a>and the <a href=\"https://anagency.com.au/privacy-cookies/\" target=\"_blank\">privacy policy of ANAGENCY.COM.AU PTY LTD</a>, respectively.</p>",
        "submit_button_text": "Send",
