    "image_with_text_list_BxG4Xt": {
      "type": "image-with-text-list",
      "blocks": {
        "image_with_text_item_7GaeR8": {
          "type": "image_with_text_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "personalised shopify experiences",
            "text": "<p>Your online store isn’t just another URL. It’s a destination for your customers to connect with your brand. Go beyond cookie-cutter designs and get a Shopify experience that’s as unique as your brand. From curated shopping journeys to custom product recommendations, delight your customers on every page and every step of the way through your store.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image4.svg"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_item_tVkqM8": {
          "type": "image_with_text_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Smart, conversion-driven design",
            "text": "<p>Your online store is only as good as it’s ability to get sales. Convert visitors into customers with Shopify stores that are not only visually stunning but also intuitively designed to drive sales. With a focus on user experience, we design every element to guide visitors towards making a purchase, boosting your conversion rates and elevating your brand.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image5.svg"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_item_jrFdTA": {
          "type": "image_with_text_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "all-in-one Shopify solutions",
            "text": "<p>Everything you need to create the perfect digital storefront—from design to development, work with one team that understands your business, customers and goals. And when you’re ready to get growing, we’ll be there to help you with your organic marketing and paid advertising strategies to fuel your new site’s visibility.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image6.svg"
          }
        }
      },
